      "id": "mdw-traveler",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 1250,
      "speaker": "Traveler",
      "lines": [
        "You there \u2014 small one. Alone on this road?",
        "A family passed through two days back. Worn out, asking after a child. They pressed on east, toward the pass.",
        "It's a hard road ahead. What will you do?"
      ],
      "choices": [
        "Press on after them",
        "Ask what else they said"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "Then walk fast and rest when you must. East, always east.",
        "Only that they'd wait where they could. Look for signs at the waysides \u2014 cairns, shrines. Travelers leave word there."
      ]
